[{:db/id 17592186124801 :question/problem "Which of the following shaded regions corresponds to the domain of the function $g(x,y)=\\frac{1}{x-y}?$" :question/worked-solution "The function is well-defined at all points $(x,y)$ for which the following condition is satisfied:\n\n- The expression in the denominator is not equal to zero.\n\nAs a result, the points in the domain must satisfy the following inequality:\n\n$$\nx-y\\ne 0\\,⟹\\,y\\ne x\n$$\n\nTherefore, the domain is\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,y\\ne x}.\n$$\n\nSince the expression involves the $\\ne $ sign, the line is *not* part of the domain. Therefore, we draw the dashed line $y=x$ and shade *above* and *below* the line.\n\nThe resulting domain is as follows:\n\n![](images/69/6953e2f817a786ae5ea52ea224a31b12a40a3ca89999a6bd5b1453eec11f8559.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186121403 :answer-field/correct 17592186121408 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "activity-b2fb8c6f-93f0-54a5-8f0c-d3aee90f2a9b" :activity/id #uuid "b2fb8c6f-93f0-54a5-8f0c-d3aee90f2a9b" :activity/title "The Domain of a Multivariable Function" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186050992 :activity/course 17592186046659 :activity/steps ["step-e9dc22fd-7547-5b94-95b7-ace0ad096377" "step-596527ae-7d3c-5d49-9792-ae1c3070a5b2" "step-1967cc1b-8c66-55dd-a6aa-4a116ffa9f8c"] :activity/first-step "step-e9dc22fd-7547-5b94-95b7-ace0ad096377" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-e9dc22fd-7547-5b94-95b7-ace0ad096377" :step/id #uuid "e9dc22fd-7547-5b94-95b7-ace0ad096377" :step/content 17592186275453 :step/next "step-596527ae-7d3c-5d49-9792-ae1c3070a5b2" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-596527ae-7d3c-5d49-9792-ae1c3070a5b2" :step/id #uuid "596527ae-7d3c-5d49-9792-ae1c3070a5b2" :step/content 17592186124798 :step/next "step-1967cc1b-8c66-55dd-a6aa-4a116ffa9f8c" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-1967cc1b-8c66-55dd-a6aa-4a11